        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 5102D, Durango Key in Lever with Round #2 Rosette</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Sandcast Bronze Durango Lever with Round Rose features a beautiful blending of traditional and modern design aesthetics for a door lever that has it's finger on the pulse of transitional decor. This Durango Key in Lever with Round #2 Rosette is available in flat black bronze, medium bronze, and white bronze finishes. It will fit doors with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets that are 1-1/4 inches to 2-3/4 inches thick. Emtek's Durango Lever with #2 Rosette is available as a keyed entry or dummy function. The keyed entry is operated by a key from the exterior and a thumbturn from the interior while a dummy lever is just for looks and does not latch nor lock.  \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSandcasting is a process for casting metal in sand molds. The mold is made by packing the sand around a pattern. Molten bronze is then poured into a mold cavity formed out of sand. Each sand mold is used only once. The sand is then recycled for the next piece.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> for the Emtek Durango Lever with #2 Rosette:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Clearance: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Thickness: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Doors Thickness: 1-1/4\" - 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 2-1/8\" door preparations.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Keyed Entry (Keyed Lock):</b> Use when a keyed lock is needed. The lock is operated by a key from the exterior and a thumbturn on the lever from the interior. Complete set - 2 levers, 2 roses, keys, door latch, and strike plate.\r\n<li><b>Dummy:</b> Trim for non-working doors. It does not latch and does not lock. Usually used as matching trim for the non-working side of double doors.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nLevers are Handed. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Handing Guide</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-sandcast-finish.jpg?v=1704354510\" width=\"570\" height=\"191\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
